\r\n\r\nRotationAxis is now displayed in Gizmo. Also, it is now possible to specify an arbitrary axis for RotationAxis with Vector3 (which will be normalized internally).\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77643b73-d4d0-4faf-a5e9-168022092392)\r\n\r\nFurthermore, some static methods (in C++) used in SpringBone have been moved to SkeletonModifier because we plan to use them in common for IK and etc.\r\n\r\n**Bugfix:**\r\n\r\nFixed an issue where the initial pose would corrupt depending on forward_axis if rotation_axis is specified.\r\n\r\nBefore (set Y to rotation axis):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4517a5eb-9a54-4d62-971f-7874ece74ec8)\r\n\r\nAfter fix (set Y to rotation axis):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/119e7d7b-65b0-4056-9f5d-b3784e5a28d0)\r\n\r\nAlso fix end bone `FromParent` mode didn't consider parent rest space correctly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22